Package: terrascopes5p
Title: Download Sentinel-5P Data from Terrascope STAC API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Stefan", "Weingartner", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A general-purpose downloader for Sentinel-5P Level 3 products
    (NO2, SO2, O3, etc.) from the Terrascope STAC API. Supports arbitrary
    bounding boxes, date ranges, and collections. Authentication via
    environment variables.
